{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "midi-lfo3",
 "version": "1.0",
 "title": "MIDI LFO3",
 "description": "Adds a third LFO to MIDI tracks. It has its own page, LFO (3/3), after LFO1 and LFO2, with the same controls (SPD, MULT, FADE, DEST, WAVE, SPH, MODE, DEP). Its DEST can be any MIDI-track destination, CCs included, and it is saved with the project like the other two.",
